---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import site from '../../data/site.json';
---

<Layout title={`Privacy — ${site.name}`}>
  <section class="prose">
    <p class="eyebrow">YOUR CHOICES</p>
    <h1>Thoughtful about privacy, too.</h1>
    <p>
      This demo uses optional first-party analytics. Browsing and search work without accepting
      analytics.
    </p>
    <h2>What we measure</h2>
    <p>
      If you agree, a random browser identifier connects page views, searches, product views, and
      marketplace clicks. It does not identify you across devices. Analytics does not require your
      name, email, or phone number.
    </p>
    <h2>Search</h2>
    <p>
      When semantic search is enabled, search text is sent to Cloudflare’s embedding service to find
      relevant products. Avoid entering personal information. Analytics stores redacted search text
      only when you opt in.
    </p>
    <h2>How long data stays</h2>
    <p>
      Recent events stay in the analytics database for up to 30 days and in private archives for up
      to 180 days. Search text is excluded from archives. Anonymous aggregate counts may be kept for
      24 months. Browser identifiers expire after 90 days.
    </p>
    <h2>Your controls</h2>
    <h3>Recommendations for this visit</h3>
    <p>
      Related products work without tracking. If you choose the option below, up to eight recently
      viewed product IDs in this tab help order recommendations. This optional history expires after
      30 minutes of inactivity and is cleared when you turn it off or delete browsing history. It is
      separate from analytics consent.
    </p>
    <label>
      <input type="checkbox" id="session-personalization" /> Use my recent views in this tab to
      tailor related products
    </label>
    <p>
      When analytics is allowed, we also measure visible recommendations and clicks. If a ranking
      experiment is enabled, consenting browsers receive a consistent version. These measurements
      are not purchases.
    </p>
    <p>
      Cookie preferences let you allow or decline future analytics. Deleting this browser’s history
      also removes its recorded events and archived history. This cannot delete purchases or
      activity on external marketplaces.
    </p>
    <button id="delete-history" class="button secondary">
      Delete this browser’s history
    </button>
    <p id="delete-status" role="status"></p>
    <h2>Mannpasand and parent notes</h2>
    <p>
      Mannpasand stores saved product IDs only in this browser. Remove saved items on the Mannpasand
      page or clear this site's browser storage. It does not sync across devices.
    </p>
    <p>
      Optional parent notes collect your chosen public display name, avatar, rating and review.
      Notes are held privately for owner review before publication and are not purchase-verified. Do
      not include contact details or information identifying children. You can withdraw your
      submitted note from its product's review form on this browser; clearing browser storage
      removes that withdrawal key. Notes remain until withdrawn or removed by the owner. Review
      submission is separate from optional analytics.
    </p>
    <p>
      To avoid repeated prompts, this browser remembers the first time you opened a product and
      whether its later-visit reminder was shown. It sends no browsing history for this reminder.
      Clearing site storage resets these preferences. Deleting analytics history does not remove
      Mannpasand or submitted notes.
    </p>
    <h2>Before launch</h2>
    <p>
      This is a development privacy notice. Business contact details and the final policy must be
      added before publishing.
    </p>
  </section>
</Layout>
